# Copy the lines below into the [Rule] section of an existing Loon profile.
# Keep them above broad Global, Google, China, or proxy rules.
# The policy-group names must exactly match your own group names.

# AI -> good subscription only
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com,AI-好
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com,AI-好
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com,AI-好
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com,AI-好
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatsig.com,AI-好
DOMAIN,cdn.openaimerge.com,AI-好
DOMAIN,chat.openai.com.cdn.cloudflare.net,AI-好

# PressReader -> Japan nodes from the lower-priority subscription only
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pressreader.com,PressReader-日本-差
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pressreader.io,PressReader-日本-差
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pressdisplay.com,PressReader-日本-差
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,prcdn.co,PressReader-日本-差
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,newspaperdirect.com,PressReader-日本-差
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ndcds.net,PressReader-日本-差
DOMAIN,ndcds.trafficmanager.net,PressReader-日本-差

# Domestic -> direct; all other unmatched traffic -> lower-priority subscription
GEOIP,CN,DIRECT
FINAL,普通代理-差
